OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fscattered showers and sunny spells,
OL,7,Fbest of the sunshine along the east
OL,8,Fcoast. Showers occasionally heavy with
OL,9,Fa chance of hail and thunder,
OL,10,Fespecially in the north and west.
OL,11,FBreezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers will gradually die
OL,14,Faway through this evening. Then the
OL,15,Frest of the night will be mainly dry
OL,16,Fwith clear periods. Chilly in
OL,17,Fsheltered parts of Deeside.
OL,18,
OL,19,CFriday:FStarting off dry with some
OL,20,Fsunshine. Cloudier in the afternoon
OL,21,Fwith a few passing showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
